⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Young Neil
node SPW · SPW · ⟦Young Neil:SPW:d83dbf⟧

WHO   — Young Neil — the hanger-on who becomes the band
WHAT  — The tag-along who games while the drama happens, crushes quietly on Knives, and at the end inherits the bass to become, simply, ‘Neil’ — the band's last man standing.
WHERE — SPW · Scott Pilgrim vs. the World  Framework inputs: Scott Pilgrim vs. the World (2010); O'Malley's graphic novels  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the loyal background figure is also a person with a life, and sometimes the story passes to the one who just kept showing up.
HOW   — By patience, proximity, and a controller — outlasting the supernovas until the role is his.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  Everybody called me Young Neil — I just stayed in the room until I was the one left holding the bass.

